{{#> layout title=title page=page}}{{#*inline "content"}}
<section class="sp-p-skills" data-portfolio data-generation="{{health.generation}}.{{inventory.generation}}.{{installations.generation}}">
{{#> components/page-header title=title subtitle="Cost, use and health for every skill."}}
{{#*inline "header_actions"}}<form method="post" action="/admin/analysis/inventory/sync" class="sp-inventory-inline"><input type="hidden" name="back" value="/admin/analysis/resources"><button class="sp-btn sp-btn--sm sp-btn--outline" type="submit" title="Capture every configured skill and publish the latest revision now, instead of waiting for the next scheduled pass">Sync inventory now</button></form> <a class="sp-btn sp-btn--sm sp-btn--primary" href="/admin/analysis/skills?start={{start}}&amp;end={{end}}">Conversations</a>{{/inline}}
{{/components/page-header}}
{{> analysis-subnav}}

{{#if onboarding}}
<ol class="sp-inventory-steps">
  <li class="sp-inventory-steps__step{{#if onboarding.marketplaces}} is-done{{/if}}"><span class="sp-inventory-steps__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>Import or pin a marketplace <a class="sp-table__link" href="/admin/sync">Code &amp; Instance</a></li>
  <li class="sp-inventory-steps__step{{#if onboarding.inventory}} is-done{{/if}}"><span class="sp-inventory-steps__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>Sync the inventory so every skill has an entry</li>
  <li class="sp-inventory-steps__step{{#if onboarding.snapshot}} is-done{{/if}}"><span class="sp-inventory-steps__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>Wait for the first snapshot — figures appear once it lands</li>
</ol>
{{/if}}

<p class="sp-inventory-summary">{{#if all_view}}All marketplaces{{else}}{{#if selected_marketplace_name}}{{selected_marketplace_name}}{{else}}No marketplace{{/if}}{{/if}} · {{kpis.skills}} skills across {{plugin_count}} plugins · {{audience}} people entitled · <a class="sp-table__link" href="/admin/analysis/versions" title="Where these skills came from and every generation since">Sources</a></p>

<div class="sp-kpi-grid sp-kpi-grid--compact">
{{> components/kpi label="Skills" value=kpis.skills note=(concat kpis.measured " measured")}}
{{> components/kpi label="Attributed use" value=kpis.attributed tone="ok" note="invocations with verified evidence"}}
{{> components/kpi label="Failing" value=kpis.failing tone="err" note="name collision or >10% failed"}}
{{> components/kpi label="Requests" value=kpis.requests note=(concat kpis.failed_requests " failed")}}
{{> components/kpi label="Spend" value=kpis.cost note="related, overlaps across skills"}}
</div>

<div class="sp-inventory-status">
<p class="sp-inventory-status__live"><span data-live-status role="status" aria-live="polite">{{#if pending_jobs}}Preparing the requested range…{{else}}Inventory generation {{inventory.generation}} · {{#if synced_at}}synced {{relativeTime synced_at}}{{else}}never synced{{/if}} · snapshot {{snapshot_state}}{{/if}}</span>{{#if unbound}} · {{unbound}} not bound yet, so unmeasured until the next sync{{/if}} · <a class="sp-table__link" href="/admin/analysis/versions">Generation timeline</a></p>
<p data-freshness hidden>{{generated_at}} · pending facts {{health.pending_changes}} · producer changes {{health.pending_producer_changes}} {{health.last_error}} {{inventory.last_error}}</p>
<p data-unknown-usage hidden>{{#if totals}}{{unknown_usage}} invocations have unknown resource attribution.{{/if}}</p>
{{#if collisions}}
<div class="sp-notice sp-notice--err" role="status">
<p class="sp-notice__title">Name collisions</p>
<p>{{collision_count}} skills exist both as files in services/ and as an imported managed resource with the same id. Metrics cannot attach until you choose which one counts.</p>
<details class="sp-collisions">
<summary class="sp-collisions__summary">Resolve</summary>
<ul class="sp-collisions__list">
{{#each collisions}}
<li class="sp-collisions__item">
<span class="sp-collisions__key">{{this.resource_key}}</span>
<span class="sp-u-text-tertiary sp-u-mono">services/{{this.configured_key}}</span>
{{#if this.candidates}}<form method="post" action="/admin/analysis/resources/{{this.entry_id}}/bind" class="sp-inventory-bind"><label class="sp-u-sr-only" for="bind-{{this.entry_id}}">Bind {{this.resource_key}} to a managed resource</label><select class="sp-select" id="bind-{{this.entry_id}}" name="resource_id">{{#each this.candidates}}<option value="{{this.id}}">{{this.source_name}}</option>{{/each}}</select><button class="sp-btn sp-btn--xs sp-btn--outline" type="submit">Bind</button></form>{{else}}<span class="sp-u-text-tertiary">no imported resource to bind to</span>{{/if}}
</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
</details>
</div>
{{/if}}
</div>

{{#> components/toolbar toolbar_count=(concat kpis.skills " skills")}}
{{#*inline "toolbar_filters"}}
<form class="sp-toolbar__filter" method="get" action="/admin/analysis/resources" data-marketplace-switcher>
<input type="hidden" name="kind" value="{{kind}}">
<div class="sp-toolbar__field"><label class="sp-toolbar__field-label" for="pf-marketplace">Marketplace</label><select class="sp-select" id="pf-marketplace" name="marketplace">{{#each marketplace_options}}<option value="{{this.id}}"{{#if this.is_selected}} selected{{/if}}>{{this.name}} ({{this.skills}})</option>{{/each}}</select></div>
<div class="sp-toolbar__field"><label class="sp-toolbar__field-label" for="pf-days">Window</label><select class="sp-select" id="pf-days" name="days"><option value="7"{{#if (eq days 7)}} selected{{/if}}>7 days</option><option value="30"{{#if (eq days 30)}} selected{{/if}}>30 days</option><option value="90"{{#if (eq days 90)}} selected{{/if}}>90 days</option><option value="365"{{#if (eq days 365)}} selected{{/if}}>365 days</option></select></div>
<div class="sp-toolbar__field"><label class="sp-toolbar__field-label" for="pf-search">Skill</label><input class="sp-search-input" type="search" id="pf-search" name="search" value="{{search}}" placeholder="Find a skill…" maxlength="200"></div>
<button class="sp-btn sp-btn--sm sp-btn--primary" type="submit">Apply</button>
</form>
{{/inline}}
{{#*inline "toolbar_actions"}}{{#if search}}<a class="sp-btn sp-btn--xs sp-btn--ghost" href="/admin/analysis/resources">Clear</a>{{/if}} {{#if columns_all}}<a class="sp-btn sp-btn--xs sp-btn--ghost" href="/admin/analysis/resources?days={{days}}&amp;marketplace={{selected_marketplace}}">Fewer columns</a>{{else}}<a class="sp-btn sp-btn--xs sp-btn--ghost" href="/admin/analysis/resources?days={{days}}&amp;marketplace={{selected_marketplace}}&amp;columns=all">All columns</a>{{/if}} <a class="sp-btn sp-btn--xs sp-btn--outline" href="/admin/analysis/resources.json?days={{days}}{{#if filter_marketplace}}&amp;marketplace={{filter_marketplace}}{{/if}}">JSON</a>{{/inline}}
{{/components/toolbar}}

{{#> components/table caption="Skills with retained usage, audience, spend, latency and publication state" modifier="sp-analysis-table sp-inventory-table"}}
<thead><tr>
<th scope="col">Skill</th><th scope="col">Health</th>
<th scope="col" class="sp-table__cell--num" title="Invocations attributed to this skill, and the share of them carrying verified evidence">Invocations</th>
<th scope="col" class="sp-table__cell--num" title="users / audience — distinct consumers over the people entitled to receive it">Users</th>
<th scope="col" class="sp-table__cell--num" title="Attributed requests, with failures in red">Requests</th>
{{#if columns_all}}<th scope="col" class="sp-table__cell--num" title="Input / output tokens on attributed requests">Tokens</th>{{/if}}
<th scope="col" class="sp-table__cell--num">Cost</th><th scope="col" class="sp-table__cell--num">p95</th>
{{#if columns_all}}<th scope="col" title="Scored / assessed conversations">Assessed</th>{{/if}}
<th scope="col" class="sp-table__cell--num" title="Acknowledged / eligible devices">Coverage</th>
<th scope="col" title="Generation the bridge serves; a dot means the latest capture is not yet published">Published</th>
<th scope="col" class="sp-table__cell--actions"><span class="sp-u-sr-only">Actions</span></th>
</tr></thead>
<tbody>
{{#each groups}}
{{#if ../all_view}}
<tr class="sp-inventory-caption sp-inventory-caption--marketplace"><th scope="rowgroup" colspan="12">{{marketplace_name}} <span class="sp-inventory-rollup">{{rollup.skills}} skills · {{rollup.used}} used · {{rollup.failing}} failing · {{users_with_access}} people</span></th></tr>
{{/if}}
{{#each plugins}}
<tr class="sp-inventory-caption"><th scope="rowgroup" colspan="12">{{plugin_name}} <span class="sp-inventory-rollup">{{rollup.skills}} skills</span></th></tr>
{{#each rows}}
<tr class="sp-inventory-row" data-skill="{{resource_key}}" data-status="{{usage_status}}">
<td class="sp-table__cell--primary sp-inventory-cell-id"><a class="sp-table__link" href="{{drilldown_href}}" title="{{resource_key}} — conversations that used this skill">{{resource_key}}</a>{{#if ../../../all_view}}{{#if plugin_id}} <span class="sp-u-text-tertiary sp-u-mono">{{plugin_id}}</span>{{/if}}{{/if}}</td>
<td>{{> components/badge tone=health_tone text=health_reason}}</td>
<td class="sp-table__cell--num sp-u-num">{{#if figures.measured}}{{figures.invocations}}{{#if figures.attributed_pct}} <span class="sp-u-text-tertiary">{{figures.attributed_pct}}%</span>{{/if}}{{else}}<span class="sp-u-text-tertiary">{{#if (eq usage_status "pending")}}pending{{else}}{{#if (eq usage_status "suppressed")}}suppressed{{else}}unbound{{/if}}{{/if}}</span>{{/if}}</td>
<td class="sp-table__cell--num sp-u-num">{{#if figures.distinct_users}}{{figures.distinct_users}}{{else}}0{{/if}} / {{#if users_with_access}}{{users_with_access}}{{else}}<span class="sp-u-text-danger">0</span>{{/if}}</td>
<td class="sp-table__cell--num sp-u-num">{{#if figures.measured}}{{figures.requests}}{{#if figures.failed_requests}} <span class="sp-u-text-danger">{{figures.failed_requests}} failed</span>{{/if}}{{else}}<span class="sp-u-text-tertiary">—</span>{{/if}}</td>
{{#if ../../../columns_all}}<td class="sp-table__cell--num sp-u-num">{{tokens_in}} / {{tokens_out}}</td>{{/if}}
<td class="sp-table__cell--num sp-u-num">{{cost}}</td>
<td class="sp-table__cell--num sp-u-num">{{p95}}</td>
{{#if ../../../columns_all}}<td class="sp-table__cell--num sp-u-num">{{#if figures.measured}}{{figures.assessed_conversations}} / {{figures.assessment_conversations}}{{else}}<span class="sp-u-text-tertiary">—</span>{{/if}}</td>{{/if}}
<td class="sp-table__cell--num sp-u-num">{{#if installation}}{{installation.current_acknowledged_devices}} / {{installation.eligible_devices}}{{else}}<span class="sp-u-text-tertiary">—</span>{{/if}}</td>
<td>{{#if published_generation}}gen {{published_generation}}{{else}}<span class="sp-u-text-tertiary">never</span>{{/if}}{{#if unpublished_revision}} <span class="sp-inventory-dot" title="The latest capture is not the served generation yet"></span>{{/if}}</td>
<td class="sp-table__cell--actions">{{#if catalog_href}}<a class="sp-table__link" href="{{catalog_href}}" title="Open this skill in the marketplace catalog">Catalog</a>{{/if}}</td>
</tr>
{{/each}}
{{/each}}
{{else}}
<tr class="sp-table__empty"><td colspan="12">{{> components/empty-state title="No skills here" message="No skill matches this marketplace and search. Pick another marketplace, clear the search, or sync the inventory."}}</td></tr>
{{/each}}
</tbody>
{{/components/table}}

<details class="sp-analysis-definitions"><summary>How to read this table</summary>
<p>The page opens on the marketplace with the most attributed use. The Marketplace field switches it; <em>All marketplaces</em> groups every marketplace at once and names the plugin beside each skill. Tokens and Assessed are behind <em>All columns</em>.</p>
<p>Every row offers the same two links. The <strong>skill name</strong> opens the conversations that used the skill in this window, and says so plainly when there are none. <strong>Catalog</strong> opens the skill in the marketplace catalog, which is where its contents and entitlement live.</p>
<p>Across this window the organisation recorded {{kpis.invocations}} invocations from {{kpis.users}} people, with a p95 latency of {{kpis.p95}}. Every figure is read from the retained feedback snapshot; nothing is recomputed from raw events, and the headline tiles include traffic not yet attributed to any skill.</p>
<p>A row is measured once its inventory entry is bound to a managed resource and a snapshot exists for it. Attribution needs verified evidence — a device-authenticated consumer, a session binding, a verified installation receipt — so a skill used without that chain counts in the totals but not in its own row. Audience is the number of signed-in people entitled to receive the skill through at least one marketplace.</p>
<p>Health is red for a name collision, an unavailable or withdrawn entry, and for more than 10% failed requests; amber for unbound or audience-less skills and for measured skills with no attributed use; grey while a bound resource waits for its first snapshot.</p>
<p>Published names the generation the bridge serves. The sync runs every minute, captures the skill on disk and publishes it as the next generation when it differs. A dot means the latest capture is not the served one yet. A skill carried by two plugins appears under each; rollups count it once. Related spend overlaps across skills and must not be summed.</p>
</details>
</section>
{{/inline}}{{#*inline "scripts"}}<script type="module" src="/js/pages/analysis-portfolio.js?v={{css_version}}"></script>{{/inline}}{{/layout}}
